%% Sangati AI — Override & Broadcast Flow
%% Mermaid flowchart: Manager override logic and broadcast alert path

flowchart TD
    A[Alert Generated by Rules Engine] --> B{System Mode?}

    B -->|OFF| Z[No alerts delivered]
    B -->|QUIET| C{Is alert CRITICAL?}
    B -->|FULL| D[Route to primary recipient]

    C -->|No| Z
    C -->|Yes| D

    D --> E{Is zone muted?}
    E -->|Yes| Z
    E -->|No| F[Deliver to assigned staff]

    F --> G{Response within timeout?}

    G -->|ACK| H[Alert acknowledged<br/>Escalation cancelled]
    G -->|SNOOZE| I[Alert snoozed 5 min<br/>Re-check after snooze]
    G -->|OVERRIDE: NOT VALID| J[Alert suppressed<br/>Zone muted 10 min<br/>Logged as false positive]
    G -->|No response| K[ESCALATE to next tier]

    H --> L[Staff handles task]
    L --> M[Staff taps DONE]
    M --> N[Alert RESOLVED<br/>Dedup key cleared]

    I --> O{Zone state still<br/>triggers rule?}
    O -->|Yes| F
    O -->|No| N

    K --> P{Current Tier?}
    P -->|Tier 1: Server| Q[Escalate to Captain<br/>Timeout: 120s]
    P -->|Tier 2: Captain| R[Escalate to Manager<br/>Timeout: 180s]
    P -->|Tier 3: Manager| S[BROADCAST to all devices<br/>+ Kitchen display<br/>+ Manager station TV]

    Q --> G
    R --> G
    S --> T[Broadcast alert shown<br/>on ALL connected devices]

    subgraph Manager Override Actions
        U[Manager opens dashboard]
        U --> V{Override type?}
        V -->|Single alert| W[Dismiss one alert<br/>Log: override_single]
        V -->|Mute zone| X[Suppress zone for<br/>15m / 30m / shift<br/>Log: override_zone]
        V -->|Change mode| Y[Switch to QUIET or OFF<br/>Requires PIN<br/>Auto-revert at shift end<br/>Log: override_mode]
    end

    style Z fill:#ccc,color:#666
    style S fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style N fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style J fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
